# MasterDetail

> Lede 0.7.0's docs for MasterDetail, installed with it. Setup, and every item in the release: [README.md](README.md). Online: https://lede.cloudcompute.com/reference/master-detail.md

A list and its detail as two named regions, side by side on wide screens. On narrow screens the route picks one to show, and `useStackedPanes` says which layout is on.

## Install

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add @lede/master-detail @lede/selection-bar @lede/list @lede/checkbox
```

The command needs Lede's registry in `components.json`, as [README.md](README.md#use-it-in-a-shadcn-project) shows. It also installs the items [`lede-theme`](lede-theme.md) and [`lede-utils`](lede-utils.md). It adds [`selection-bar`](https://lede.cloudcompute.com/reference/selection-bar.md), [`list`](https://lede.cloudcompute.com/reference/list.md) and [`checkbox`](https://lede.cloudcompute.com/reference/checkbox.md) only because the example below imports them. The item's JSON, with each file's source, is https://lede.cloudcompute.com/r/v0.7.0/master-detail.json.

